<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s082-16.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s082-16.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1860 ;
    djr:text "\n1. **입장된 독립 integration failure가 있는데 그 boundary 보호가 없음** (반대 방향도 동일 — 단순히 한 계층만 존재한다는 이유로 다른 계층 테스트를 추가하지 않음)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s082-16.2/b10> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s082-16.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 10 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s082-16.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s082-16.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "2. **잘못된 테스트 유형 선택**: 단위 테스트로 충분한데 E2E로 작성\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s082-16.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s082-16.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "3. **테스트를 개발 프로세스의 별도 단계로 취급**: 코딩 후 나중에 한꺼번에 테스트 작성\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s082-16.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s082-16.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "4. **테스트 코드를 프로덕션 코드보다 낮은 품질로 작성**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s082-16.2/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s082-16.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:text "5. **비결정적(flaky) 테스트를 방치**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s082-16.2/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s082-16.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:text "6. **느린 테스트를 개선하지 않음**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s082-16.2/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s082-16.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:text "7. **테스트를 수동으로 실행** (CI/CD 미연동)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s082-16.2/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s082-16.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:text "8. **코드 커버리지에만 집착**: 커버리지 100%가 버그 0%를 의미하지 않음\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s082-16.2/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s082-16.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:text "> 출처: [Software Testing Anti-patterns - Codepipes Blog](https://blog.codepipes.com/testing/software-testing-antipatterns.html), [Unit Testing Anti-Patterns Full List - DZone](https://dzone.com/articles/unit-testing-anti-patterns-full-list)\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s083-17> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 17. Mutation Testing [mutmut]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "17" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s083-17/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s083-17> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1861, djr:R-1862, djr:R-1863, djr:R-1864 ;
    djr:text "\n이 절은 이미 입장된 테스트가 주장한 failure를 실제로 감지하는지 진단하는 mechanics다. mutation score·생존 mutant·도구 권고는 새 영구 test case/assertion을 승인하지 않는다. 생존 mutant는 `discipline-tdd` §5.5의 candidate로 보내며, 제품 계약과 독자 failure가 없거나 기존 보호와 중복이면 `reject`·`reuse`한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s088-17.5> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 17.5 뮤테이션 점수 목표"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "17.5" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s088-17.5/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s088-17.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1865, djr:R-1866, djr:R-1867 ;
    djr:text "\n뮤테이션 점수는 진단 정보이지 목표 quota나 완료 조건이 아니다. 생존 mutant를 분석하되, 승인된 제품 계약의 독자 failure가 확인된 `add/update`에만 테스트를 작성한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s088-17.5/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s088-17.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s092-19> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 19. Django Ninja API 계약 테스트"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "19" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s092-19/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s092-19> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1868, djr:R-1869 ;
    djr:text "\n이 절의 client·assert 예시는 `discipline-tdd` §5.5에서 입장된 API 계약의 작성 mechanics다. framework 동작이나 도구 사용법을 확인하기 위해 endpoint·status·Schema 테스트를 추가하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s092-19/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s092-19> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1870 ;
    djr:text "Django Ninja의 **공개 HTTP 계약**은 실제 URLconf에 mount된 endpoint를 Django test client로 호출해 검증한다. 그래야 registrar·URL prefix·middleware·인증과 실제 API instance를 함께 지난다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s092-19/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s092-19> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1871, djr:R-1872 ;
    djr:text "`ninja.testing.TestClient(router)`나 `ninja_extra.testing.TestClient(Controller)`는 별도 입장된 **adapter-local 계약**에서 mount와 무관한 독자 failure를 보호할 때만 쓸 수 있다. middleware·URL resolver·registrar를 통과하지 않으므로 public HTTP/OpenAPI 증거를 대신하지 못하고, 같은 failure를 mounted 테스트가 이미 보호하면 `reuse`다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s093-19.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 19.1 Mounted 공개 응답 계약"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "19.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s093-19.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s093-19.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\nfrom django.test import Client\n\n\nclient = Client()\n\n\ndef test_order_detail_contract(order_factory):\n    order = order_factory(status=\"paid\", total_amount=\"120.00\")\n\n    response = client.get(f\"/api/orders/{order.id}\")\n\n    assert response.status_code == 200\n    assert response.json() == {\n        \"id\": order.id,\n        \"status\": \"paid\",\n        \"total_amount\": \"120.00\",\n    }\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s093-19.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s093-19.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1873, djr:R-1874 ;
    djr:text "검증 대상은 입장된 public API contract다. 내부 service 호출 여부, private helper, ORM query 문자열처럼 구현 세부사항은 직접 검증하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s094-19.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 19.2 요청 검증과 오류 응답"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "19.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s094-19.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s094-19.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1875, djr:R-1876 ;
    djr:text "\n`discipline-tdd` §5.5의 decision row가 `add`·`update`인 오류 계약에만 이 절을 적용한다.\n오류 Schema가 존재하거나 framework가 응답을 직렬화한다는 사실만으로 테스트를 만들지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s095-19.2.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "#### 19.2.1 승인된 HTTP 오류 계약"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "19.2.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s095-19.2.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s095-19.2.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1877, djr:R-1878, djr:R-1879, djr:R-1880 ;
    djr:text "\n승인된 controller mapping은 실제 URLconf에 mount된 Django client 요청으로 관찰한다. application\ncollaborator가 승인된 구체 예외를 내게 하고, 응답의 HTTP status, 승인된 body와 error-sensitive\nheader 값·부재를 리터럴로 검증한다. serializer, helper, factory, mapping, handler 내부를 mock하거나\n직접 unit test하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s095-19.2.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s095-19.2.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1881, djr:R-1882, djr:R-1883, djr:R-1884 ;
    djr:text "기댓값은 해당 decision row의 승인된 리터럴을 쓰되, dddjango가 고정하는 공통 오류 schema property\n목록은 없다. 기존 공통 오류 schema shape를 바꾸려면 별도의 명시적 사용자\n승인이 필요하며, 승인 전에는 변경도 그 변경을 전제로 한 assertion도 만들지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s095-19.2.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s095-19.2.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1885, djr:R-1886, djr:R-1887, djr:R-1888 ;
    djr:text "framework-owned 401/403/route 404/422/429/`HttpError`/500은 별도 입장 행에서 승인된 경우에만\n검증한다. 별도 승인 또는 실제 deployed consumer evidence가 없는 Django Ninja/Pydantic 기본 body,\n직렬화, coercion은 제품 계약처럼 exact snapshot하지 않고 status와 민감 정보 비노출만 smoke한다.\n반대로 기존 지원 계약이나 consumer가 의존하는 public wire field가 입장됐다면 그 관련 field만\n리터럴로 검증한다. 전체 framework body snapshot이나 private metadata까지 넓히지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s096-19.2.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "#### 19.2.2 공개 Python Schema 계약"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "19.2.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s096-19.2.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s096-19.2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1889, djr:R-1890, djr:R-1891, djr:R-1892 ;
    djr:text "\nSchema를 Python에서 직접 검증하는 테스트를 일괄 금지하지 않는다. HTTP와 별개로 실제 public\nPython consumer 또는 승인된 지원 계약이 확인되면 **별도 decision row**로 입장시켜, 그 consumer가\n의존하는 field·signature·기본값·생성 의미만 검증한다. HTTP wire 테스트를 내부 Schema 호출로\n대체하거나 하나의 행에 섞지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s096-19.2.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s096-19.2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1893 ;
    djr:text "별도 공개 계약이 없는 다음 항목은 자동 제품 테스트가 아니다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s096-19.2.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s096-19.2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "- Pydantic private API와 decorator/validator 배치\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s096-19.2.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s096-19.2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "- `ValidationError.loc`의 framework 표현\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s096-19.2.2/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s096-19.2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:text "- callable source digest와 source/AST/import 형태\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s096-19.2.2/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s096-19.2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:text "- model config, hook, serializer, computed-field inventory\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s096-19.2.2/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s096-19.2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:text "- nominal inheritance나 Python/Django/Pydantic 기본 동작만 확인하는 assertion\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s097-19.2.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "#### 19.2.3 공개 OpenAPI 계약"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "19.2.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s097-19.2.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s097-19.2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1894, djr:R-1895, djr:R-1896 ;
    djr:text "\nOpenAPI가 승인된 public consumer contract이면 실제 URLconf에 mount된 문서 endpoint를 Django\nclient로 요청하고, 관련 operation·status·media type·schema만 검증한다. 전체 document나 무관한\ncomponent를 snapshot하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s097-19.2.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s097-19.2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1897, djr:R-1898 ;
    djr:text "`api.get_openapi_schema()`, schema helper, postprocessor 같은 내부 직접 호출은 실제 mounted generated\ndocument를 대신하지 않는다. OpenAPI가 공개 계약으로 승인되지 않았거나 기존 권위 테스트가 같은\noperation/status/schema drift를 보호하면 새 테스트를 만들지 않는다.\n\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s098-19.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 19.3 인증, 페이지네이션, 필터링"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "19.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s098-19.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s098-19.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\ndef test_order_list_requires_auth():\n    response = client.get(\"/api/orders\")\n\n    assert response.status_code in {401, 403}\n\n\ndef test_order_list_pagination_contract(auth_headers, order_factory):\n    order_factory.create_batch(3)\n\n    response = client.get(\"/api/orders\", {\"limit\": 2, \"offset\": 0}, headers=auth_headers)\n\n    assert response.status_code == 200\n    body = response.json()\n    assert set(body) >= {\"items\", \"count\"}\n    assert len(body[\"items\"]) == 2\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s098-19.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s098-19.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1899, djr:R-1900 ;
    djr:text "인증 우회, user fixture, header 이름은 프로젝트의 auth contract에 맞춘다. 권한/페이지네이션/필터링 계약이 불명확하면 API 설계를 먼저 확정한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s099-19.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 19.4 pytest-django DB 접근 선택"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "19.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s099-19.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s099-19.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1901, djr:R-1902 ;
    djr:text "\nDjango ORM을 사용하는 API 테스트는 pytest-django의 DB access 규칙을 따른다. 기본적으로 DB 접근은 차단되며, DB가 필요한 테스트는 `pytest.mark.django_db`, `db`, `transactional_db` 중 하나로 의도를 명시한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s099-19.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s099-19.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\nimport pytest\nfrom django.test import Client\n\n\nclient = Client()\n\n\n@pytest.mark.django_db\ndef test_order_detail_reads_database(order_factory):\n    order = order_factory()\n\n    response = client.get(f\"/api/orders/{order.id}\")\n\n    assert response.status_code == 200\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s099-19.4/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s099-19.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s103-20.3/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1903 ;
    djr:text "일반 ORM read/write 검증은 `pytest.mark.django_db`로 충분하다. commit/rollback 효과, `transaction.on_commit`, row lock, 별도 connection 관찰처럼 실제 transaction 경계가 테스트 대상이면 `pytest.mark.django_db(transaction=True)` 또는 `transactional_db` fixture를 사용한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s099-19.4/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s099-19.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "> 출처: [Django Ninja Testing](https://django-ninja.dev/guides/testing/), [pytest-django Database access](https://pytest-django.readthedocs.io/en/latest/database.html), [pytest-django helpers](https://pytest-django.readthedocs.io/en/latest/helpers.html)\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s099-19.4/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s099-19.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s100-20> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 20. Idempotency와 동시성 테스트"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "20" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s100-20/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s100-20> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1904, djr:R-1905, djr:R-1906 ;
    djr:text "\n이 절의 idempotency·transaction·race·CAS·spy recipe는 `discipline-tdd` §5.5에서 `add`·`update`된 case의 mechanics다. 동시성이라는 주제, DB 사용, 예제의 존재, 결정성·속도 개선만으로 새 테스트 수를 늘리지 않는다. domain/application/DB/adapter/public contract에서 독립 failure mechanism이 확인되면 각각 유효할 수 있고, 기존 권위 테스트가 같은 계약·boundary·failure를 보호하면 `reuse`한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s100-20/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s100-20> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1907 ;
    djr:text "입장된 중복 요청, 재시도, race condition, row lock 계약은 일반 unit test만으로 충분히 보호되지 않을 수 있다. 보호하려는 failure mechanism에 DB unique constraint, transaction, lock, idempotency storage가 관여하면 integration/API contract mechanics를 선택한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s101-20.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 20.1 Idempotency replay 계약"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "20.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s101-20.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s101-20.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1908, djr:R-1909 ;
    djr:text "\nIdempotency-Key를 지원하는 write API는 같은 key와 같은 payload의 재전송이 같은 결과를 반환하거나 기존 처리 결과를 재사용해야 한다. 서로 다른 payload가 같은 key를 재사용하면 충돌로 실패해야 한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s101-20.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s101-20.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\nimport json\n\nimport pytest\nfrom django.test import Client\n\n\nclient = Client()\n\n\n@pytest.mark.django_db\ndef test_create_order_idempotency_replays_same_result(auth_headers):\n    headers = {**auth_headers, \"Idempotency-Key\": \"order-create-001\"}\n    payload = {\"sku\": \"BOOK-1\", \"quantity\": 1}\n\n    first = client.post(\n        \"/api/orders\", data=json.dumps(payload), content_type=\"application/json\", headers=headers\n    )\n    second = client.post(\n        \"/api/orders\", data=json.dumps(payload), content_type=\"application/json\", headers=headers\n    )\n\n    assert first.status_code == 201\n    assert second.status_code in {200, 201}\n    assert second.json()[\"id\"] == first.json()[\"id\"]\n    assert Order.objects.count() == 1\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s101-20.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s101-20.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "```python\n@pytest.mark.django_db\ndef test_create_order_idempotency_rejects_payload_mismatch(auth_headers):\n    headers = {**auth_headers, \"Idempotency-Key\": \"order-create-002\"}\n\n    first = client.post(\n        \"/api/orders\",\n        data=json.dumps({\"sku\": \"BOOK-1\", \"quantity\": 1}),\n        content_type=\"application/json\",\n        headers=headers,\n    )\n    second = client.post(\n        \"/api/orders\",\n        data=json.dumps({\"sku\": \"BOOK-1\", \"quantity\": 2}),\n        content_type=\"application/json\",\n        headers=headers,\n    )\n\n    assert first.status_code == 201\n    assert second.status_code in {400, 409, 422}\n    assert Order.objects.count() == 1\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s101-20.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s101-20.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1910, djr:R-1911 ;
    djr:text "정확한 status code와 response body는 `architecture-api`에서 정한 idempotency contract를 따른다. 저장소 스키마, uniqueness, transaction boundary가 불명확하면 `architecture-db`를 먼저 사용한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s102-20.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 20.2 중복 생성 방지와 DB 제약"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "20.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s102-20.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s102-20.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\nimport pytest\nfrom django.db import IntegrityError\n\n\n@pytest.mark.django_db\ndef test_idempotency_key_is_unique_per_actor(idempotency_record_factory, user):\n    idempotency_record_factory(user=user, key=\"same-key\")\n\n    with pytest.raises(IntegrityError):\n        idempotency_record_factory(user=user, key=\"same-key\")\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s102-20.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s102-20.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1912, djr:R-1913, djr:R-1914 ;
    djr:text "서비스 계층 test와 DB unique constraint 후보가 서로 다른 failure mechanism을 보호하고 기존 DB 보장이 없다면 DB-backed `add`가 될 수 있다. 같은 계약·boundary·failure를 이미 보호하면 별도 테스트를 만들지 않는다. 입장된 DB 제약이 동작의 일부라면 mock repository로 대체하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s103-20.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 20.3 Transaction과 row lock 테스트"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "20.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s103-20.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s103-20.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1915, djr:R-1916, djr:R-1917 ;
    djr:text "\nDjango `TestCase` 계열은 각 테스트를 transaction으로 감싸므로 `select_for_update()`의 transaction 요구를 정확히 드러내지 못할 수 있다. row lock, commit/rollback, 별도 connection 관찰을 테스트할 때는 `TransactionTestCase` 또는 pytest-django의 `transaction=True`를 사용한다. **이 `TransactionTestCase → @pytest.mark.django_db(transaction=True)/transactional_db` 매핑은 실제 transaction 경계·스레드 race 테스트(§20.3·§20.4)에만 적용한다** — 단일 connection·단일 스레드로 충분한 결정적 테스트(§20.5 CAS-충돌 스파이)에까지 `transaction=True`를 다는 것은 연결 의미를 바꾸는 과(過)번역이다(거기선 plain `@pytest.mark.django_db`).\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s103-20.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s103-20.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\nimport pytest\nfrom django.db import transaction\n\n\n@pytest.mark.django_db(transaction=True)\ndef test_inventory_reservation_uses_transactional_lock(product_factory):\n    product = product_factory(stock=1)\n\n    with transaction.atomic():\n        locked = (\n            Product.objects\n            .select_for_update()\n            .get(id=product.id)\n        )\n        locked.stock -= 1\n        locked.save(update_fields=[\"stock\"])\n\n    product.refresh_from_db()\n    assert product.stock == 0\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s103-20.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s103-20.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1918 ;
    djr:text "이 예시는 transaction-capable test 선택을 보여주는 최소 형태다. 실제 동시성 보장은 두 connection, thread/process, lock timeout, `nowait=True`/`skip_locked=True`, 또는 DB별 격리 수준까지 포함해 검증해야 할 수 있다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s104-20.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 20.4 Race condition 재현 테스트"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "20.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s104-20.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s104-20.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\nfrom concurrent.futures import ThreadPoolExecutor\n\nimport pytest\n\n\n@pytest.mark.django_db(transaction=True)\ndef test_only_one_concurrent_reservation_succeeds(product_factory):\n    product = product_factory(stock=1)\n\n    def reserve_once():\n        return reserve_product(product.id, quantity=1)\n\n    with ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=2) as pool:\n        results = list(pool.map(lambda _: reserve_once(), range(2)))\n\n    assert sorted(result.success for result in results) == [False, True]\n    product.refresh_from_db()\n    assert product.stock == 0\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s104-20.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s104-20.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1919, djr:R-1920 ;
    djr:text "동시성 테스트는 DB backend와 connection 관리에 민감하다. SQLite처럼 row-lock 의미가 다른 backend에서는 이 검증이 충분하지 않을 수 있으므로 PostgreSQL 등 운영 DB와 같은 backend를 testcontainers로 띄우는 것을 고려한다. flaky test가 되면 skip으로 숨기기 전에 lock timeout, barrier, transaction boundary, cleanup fixture, random seed, DB isolation을 먼저 분석한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s104-20.4/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s104-20.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "> 출처: [Django testing tools](https://docs.djangoproject.com/en/dev/topics/testing/tools/), [Django QuerySet select_for_update](https://docs.djangoproject.com/en/4.0/ref/models/querysets/#select-for-update), [pytest-django Database access](https://pytest-django.readthedocs.io/en/latest/database.html)\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s105-20.5> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 20.5 결정적 CAS-충돌 재시도 테스트 (스파이)"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "20.5" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s105-20.5/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s105-20.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1921, djr:R-1922, djr:R-1923 ;
    djr:text "\n입장된 CAS 재시도 failure를 결정적으로 검증해야 할 때 이 recipe를 쓴다. §20.4의 스레드 race 테스트는 실제 경합을 관찰하지만 SQLite에서 비결정적이고 flaky하기 쉽다. 실제 스레드 없이 *다른 트랜잭션이 먼저 `version`을 올린 상황*을 흉내 내 CAS 0행을 1회 강제하고, 쓰기 연산이 재조회→도메인 메서드 재실행으로 일관되게 수렴하는지 검증할 수 있다. 이 결정적 recipe가 스레드 테스트를 자동으로 추가하거나 복제할 근거는 아니다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s105-20.5/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s105-20.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1924 ;
    djr:text "스파이는 실제 리포지토리를 상속해 version-guarded save만 가로채고, 첫 저장 직전 DB의 `version`을 한 번 올린다(다른 트랜잭션이 먼저 커밋한 상황의 시뮬레이션). 이후 시도는 개입하지 않으므로 정상 저장된다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s105-20.5/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s105-20.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "```python\nclass ConflictOnceRepository(DjangoProductRepository):\n    \"\"\"첫 CAS 저장 직전에 version을 한 번 올려 CAS 0행을 결정론적으로 유발하는 스파이.\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self) -> None:\n        self.save_attempts = 0\n\n    def save_with_version_guard(self, product, expected_version: int) -> bool:\n        self.save_attempts += 1\n        if self.save_attempts == 1:\n            # 첫 시도 직전 외부 갱신 — 캡처한 version을 무효화(다른 트랜잭션 흉내).\n            ProductModel.objects.filter(pk=product.id).update(version=expected_version + 1)\n        return super().save_with_version_guard(product, expected_version)\n\n\n@pytest.mark.django_db\ndef test_cas_conflict_once_then_retry_converges():\n    product = ProductModel.objects.create(stock=5, version=0)\n    reserve_stock = ReserveStockCommand(ConflictOnceRepository())\n\n    result = reserve_stock.execute(ReserveStockRequest(product_id=product.id, quantity=2))\n\n    product.refresh_from_db()\n    assert product.stock == 3  # 첫 CAS 0행 → 재시도 성공, 정확히 한 번만 차감\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s105-20.5/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s105-20.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1925, djr:R-1926 ;
    djr:text "이 테스트는 단일 connection·단일 스레드이므로 `transaction=True`가 필요 없다 — 스파이의 `.update()`와 쓰기 연산의 재조회가 같은 connection에서 일어나 갱신된 `version`을 그대로 본다. 실제 별도 connection·스레드 경합 관찰은 §20.4의 영역이다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s105-20.5/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s105-20.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1927, djr:R-1928 ;
    djr:text "이 테스트는 빠르고 결정적이어서 동시성 가드 회귀를 막는 1차 방어다. 단, 스파이가 구체 리포지토리의 `save_with_version_guard` 시그니처에 결합하므로 그 메서드명·시그니처가 바뀌면 함께 갱신한다(가드의 *내부 CAS 구현* 변경에는 영향받지 않는다). 스레드 기반 §20.4는 통합 신뢰를 위한 보조이며, 운영과 같은 backend(PostgreSQL 등)를 testcontainers로 띄워 돌리는 편이 SQLite보다 안정적이다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s105-20.5/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s105-20.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1929, djr:R-1930, djr:R-1931 ;
    djr:text "**연결 의미를 바꿔 테스트를 성립시키지 않는다.** SQLite에서 race를 *관찰*하려고 `BEGIN IMMEDIATE`·격리 수준·begin 모드가 필요해 보여도, 그것을 **커스텀 `DatabaseWrapper`/DB 백엔드로 구현하지 않는다** — 트랜잭션·락·격리 *메커니즘*은 architect가 소유하며(`architecture-db` §9.5 연결 설정 경계), 코더가 환경 한계를 이유로 임의 대체하는 것은 *출처-불문* 금지다(`implementation-django` §16.4). 필요한 연결 튜닝은 **stock `OPTIONS`만**으로 한다(IMMEDIATE는 `transaction_mode`[Django 5.1+], busy 대기는 `timeout`, 안전 PRAGMA 화이트리스트). 위 결정적 CAS-충돌 스파이는 애초에 이런 연결 조작이 필요 없다 — 그래서 §16.4 위반 압력 없이 동시성 기준을 검증한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s105-20.5/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-test/references/final.md/s105-20.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

